        // carries a settled_at that disagrees with the audit timestamp_ms — the
        // desync a JSONL edit to either timestamp would produce — while resource
        // stays Tool, the receipt_id is valid and non-nil, and both timestamps are
        // non-zero, so only the cross-record temporal arm fires.
